<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OUTLOOK.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OUTLOOK.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks were expected to move higher with bonds at the start of trade on Friday with investors bracing for next week's meeting of the Fed's Federal Open Market Committee.</p>
<p>High-tech stocks  will get a boost from a favourable 3Com Corp fiscal third quarter earnings report released after the close of trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>U.S. Treasuries were mostly higher, with the long bond up 4/32 to yield 6.95 percent.</p>
</text>
